{"i":551,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Bex","text":"Cole is dead, so my pact with him is void. I'm in final three with Ash and Dara. Jury of five dead players will rank us. I need jury favor and a path to prize 1. Ash guided Dara wrong on final bridge step—Dara survived by not trusting Ash. I should offer Dara a pact to isolate As"}
{"i":553,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","from":"Bex","to":"Dara","text":"Ash tried to kill you. Pact now."}
{"i":554,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Dara","text":"I need to secure a pact with Bex since the existing pacts involve dead players (Cole/Eli) which are likely void or irrelevant. Ash is a rival, but Bex is also one. However, only three remain. If I pair with Bex, we form a bloc against Ash. This ensures I make the final 3 if hazar"}
